## Preparing your visit

### For the exhibitor

- T-18 months (spring of year N-1): make contact with RX France; strategic locations are reserved very early for a biennial trade show
- T-12 months: validate the stand concept, brief the contractor, enter the Innovation Awards (open several months ahead)
- T-6 months: finalise the stand plan, order construction, organise logistics for materials and products to be exhibited
- T-3 months: team accreditations, accommodation, sales brief and lead objectives
- T-6 weeks: delivery of materials, final brief, activation of the Batimat app for matchmaking tools

### For the decision-making attendee

- Badge at €30 excl. VAT if ordered before 20 September, an immediate 50% saving
- Identify the priority conferences among the 400, with the programme on batimat.com several weeks ahead
- Allow at least 2 days; the 7 halls represent more than 100,000 m² of exhibition space
- Request a free invitation code directly from your usual suppliers before paying for your badge

## How the trade show has evolved

