RENODAYS Masterclass by EquipBaie (daily sessions), an immersive "summer comfort" demonstrator produced with the UPEC school in Créteil, and the Métal''Jeunes competition on the Union des Métalliers stand (source: L''Écho de la baie, Light ZOOM Lumière).

### Awards & accolades

Innovation Awards, Joinery and Façades category: 51 entries, 23 nominees, 4 winners in 2024 (source: L''Écho de la baie). For 2026, solar protection enters Batimat''s Innovation Awards (source: Batiweb).

### Community & networks

Sector integrated into the Mondial du Bâtiment. Official partners of the Pôle Fenêtre FFB supporting EquipBaie: **ACTIBAIE, SNFA, UM (Union des Métalliers), UMB-FFB, UFME**. Specialist press: Verre & Protections, L''Écho de la baie, Le Moniteur.

