- The badge grants access to the entire Mondial du Bâtiment: combine with Batimat for the full construction sector.
- Target the RENODAYS Masterclasses and the award-winning new products in Joinery and Façades.

## Policy & CSR initiatives

EquipBaie-Métalexpo''s CSR focus is on energy renovation and summer comfort: the RENODAYS Masterclasses, the "summer comfort" demonstrator and the integration of closures and solar protection into support schemes (MaPrimeRénov'') shaped the 2024 edition, with an emphasis on reuse (source: Batiweb, L''Écho de la baie). The decarbonisation theme is announced for 2026 (source: Business BTP).

## How the trade show has evolved

