## Preparing your visit

### For the exhibitor

- 8 months out (June): application to take part on paris.hyvolution.com or via a regional/CCI pavilion
- 6 months out: stand brief, identifying the right thematic pavilion (Mobility / Industry / Energy)
- 3 months out: applying for speaking slots in a Forum or exhibitor workshop (130 slots, strong competition)
- 6 weeks out: accreditations, equipment logistics, accommodation
- 1 week out: activating the Hyvolution Paris app for Hyvolution Connect matchmaking

### For the decision-maker visitor

- Free visitor badge, registration on paris.hyvolution.com
- Identify the priority conferences (Hyvolution Theater, limited places for the Summit)
- 3 days are enough to cover the show, a more uniform footprint than Vivatech
- Allow time for the Forums: 20-minute workshops packed with operational insights

## How the trade show has evolved

