- Interclima 2026 runs concurrently with Batimat and Idéobain at the Mondial du Bâtiment (renamed "Mondial du Bâtiment") from 28 September to 1 October 2026 → exhibiting at Interclima does not carry the same commercial scope as exhibiting at Batimat: it is a specialised sub-segment for HVAC engineering, not the entire construction sector.
