Exhibitor prices not published: quote on request from RX France via the exhibitors page on interclima.com. As Interclima is co-located with Batimat and organised by the same RX France, the per-m² ranges are presumably close to those of Batimat (€250-400/m² for a bare stand at Batimat 2026, source: cimbat.com), to be confirmed by a direct Interclima quote.

