### For the exhibitor

- 18 months out: make contact with RX France, request a quote, apply for the Innovation Awards.
- 12 months out: validate the stand concept, select the targeted business universe(s), brief the contractor.
- 6 months out: finalise the stand plan, place the construction order, materials logistics.
