- The badge grants access to the 3 trade shows of the Mondial du Bâtiment: plan your route accordingly.

## Policy & CSR initiatives

Interclima''s CSR dimension is structural: the trade show is steered by Uniclima around the energy and low-carbon transitions, and its 2026 programme puts decarbonisation and indoor air quality front and centre (source: interclima.com). The "Tertiary HVAC engineering" category of the Innovation Awards rewards energy performance solutions.

