 warning="Exhibitor rates are not published openly by the organisers. The Mondial de l''Auto operates through direct negotiation between Hopscotch Group / AMC Promotion and the manufacturers, with arrangements varying widely depending on the area (from a few dozen to several thousand m²), the position within the halls, and the level of scenography. The ranges below are indicative and should be confirmed in direct commercial consultation."
