## Preparing your visit

### For the exhibitor

- 18 months out (spring 2025): make contact with Hopscotch Group / AMC Promotion, positioning and choice of hall, area negotiation
- 12 months out (October 2025): validation of the scenographic concept, agency and stand-builder brief, possible applications for sector prizes
- 6 months out (April 2026): final plans, stand construction order, vehicle and equipment logistics
- 3 months out (July 2026): team accreditations, accommodation, commercial brief, B2B meeting planning, press accreditation requests via Hopscotch for the 12 October professional day
- 6 weeks out (September 2026): delivery of materials, final team brief, activation of media campaigns and VIP invitations

### For the decision-maker visitor

- Book your ticket online from June 2026: immediate saving (€20 online vs €22-24 on site, €17 evening Friday-Saturday)
- Favour Tuesday 13 or Wednesday 14 October to limit general-public crowds and facilitate exchanges with manufacturers
- For professionals: request a professional accreditation via Hopscotch Group for Monday 12 October (exclusive press and B2B access)
- Allow 2 full days to cover the 5 halls and try out the Chinese newcomers in Hall 5 and Hall 6 (dynamic test drives by reservation)
- Students, 7-17s and reduced-mobility visitors: €13 rate, proof to be presented

## How the trade show has evolved

