### Typical profile

Tradespeople, builders, renovators, kitchen fitters, landscapers, pool builders, conservatory and spa installers, materials suppliers, insulation, electrics and heating specialists, interior designers and furniture manufacturers. The trade show is aimed at an audience of private individuals with plans to buy, build, renovate or enhance their home in the Bordeaux region.

