- **Services:** free parking, free shuttles from the tram stop, children''s area and on-site catering.

## How much it costs to exhibit

Exhibitor rates are not published on the official website. Applications to take part and stand bookings are handled directly with LÉO via [leopro.fr/salon-habitat-deco-bordeaux](https://leopro.fr/salon-habitat-deco-bordeaux/). Figures not publicly available.

## Preparing your visit

